BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20260611T043850Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51375478845800
DTSTART:20260513T160000Z
DTEND:20260513T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Stress is experienced in the body as tension. To manage stress 
 we have several choices: reduce or eliminate the stressor\, think about th
 e stressor differently so it no longer causes tension or change the way ou
 r body reacts to stress. The course will address the third option through 
 exploring a variety of relaxation techniques to calm the body and mind. Th
 e class will allow participants to learn and experience several simple rel
 axation tools such as progressive muscle relaxation\, abdominal relaxation
  breathing.\n\n \n\nWorkshop Objectives\nAt the end of this workshop\, you
  will be able to:\nIdentify the benefits of relaxation\n• Lowering blood
  pressure\n• Reducing muscle tension and chronic pain\n• Reducing ange
 r and frustration\n• Improving concentration and creativity\nRecognize t
 he steps to perform several different relaxation methods such as:\n• Cul
 tivating tension awareness\n• Progressive muscle relaxation\n• Abdomin
 al or diaphragmatic breathing\n• Using sound and voice to relax\n• Lau
 ghter\n• Visualization\n\n \n\nClick on Carolina Talent registration lin
 k and select the “Request” button to automatically enroll.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Learning to Relax
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/learning-to-relax-3754
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20260611T043850Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52302893283880
DTSTART:20260513T220000Z
DTEND:20260513T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in the cosmos with breathtaking views and a mi
 ndful yoga session! Guided by instructor Laura Terry\, this relaxing exper
 ience will be offered in four separate spring sessions in the fulldome the
 ater at Morehead Planetarium.\n\n \n\nYoga Under the Stars is open to olde
 r teens and adults of all experience levels. Each session will go from 6-7
  pm and costs $30 per person or $25 for Morehead members.\n\n \n\n🎟️ 
 Tickets will be available for purchase beginning on Wednesday\, March 11.
GEO:35.913753;-79.050409
LOCATION:Morehead Planetarium and Science Center
SUMMARY:Yoga Under the Stars
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/yoga-under-the-stars-1708
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
