DESCRIPTION:Gravitate back to Morehead Planetarium and Science Center for S
 tar Families! ✨\n\n \n\nDuring a tour of the North Carolina night sky\, 
 we'll virtually lift off Earth and travel deep into the universe to explor
 e our place in space.\n\n \n\nStar Families is a special series that provi
 des an immersive\, family-friendly planetarium experience. Arrive before y
 our show or stay after to journey through Morehead's interactive exhibits\
 , science demo spaces\, and Cosmic Goods gift shop.\n\n \n\nThis program i
 s recommended for families and children ages 7+.
GEO:35.913753;-79.050409
LOCATION:Morehead Planetarium and Science Center
SUMMARY:Star Families: Your Place in Space
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/star-families-your-place-in-sp
 ace-1857
