UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51561087537193
DTSTART:20260520T160000Z
DTEND:20260520T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered why your relationship has changed from f
 eeling perfect to full of criticism and devaluation? Do you feel like you 
 are walking on eggshells? This training will demystify narcissism and disc
 uss its deep impact on relationships. Additionally\, this session will hel
 p you understand the stages of narcissism\, common manipulation maneuvers 
 and solutions for responding and healing. Key skills addressed will be set
 ting boundaries\, staying calm\, and managing the conversation.\n\nWorksho
 p Objectives:\n\n• Define narcissism\n• Recognize the two faces of nar
 cissistic behavior\n• Understand the relationship cycle\n• Identify co
 mmon manipulation tactics\n• Navigate the path to healing and empowermen
 t\n\nClick on Carolina Talent registration link and select the “Request
 ” button to automatically enroll.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Responding to Narcissism
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/responding-to-narcissism
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20260611T043850Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52302893284905
DTSTART:20260520T220000Z
DTEND:20260520T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in the cosmos with breathtaking views and a mi
 ndful yoga session! Guided by instructor Laura Terry\, this relaxing exper
 ience will be offered in four separate spring sessions in the fulldome the
 ater at Morehead Planetarium.\n\n \n\nYoga Under the Stars is open to olde
 r teens and adults of all experience levels. Each session will go from 6-7
  pm and costs $30 per person or $25 for Morehead members.\n\n \n\n🎟️ 
 Tickets will be available for purchase beginning on Wednesday\, March 11.
GEO:35.913753;-79.050409
LOCATION:Morehead Planetarium and Science Center
SUMMARY:Yoga Under the Stars
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/yoga-under-the-stars-1708
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
