DESCRIPTION:A virtual onboarding series for principal investigators (PIs)\,
  faculty\, and project/program leads across campus. The program offers an 
 introductory overview of key responsibilities involved in leading and mana
 ging a research program. Topics will include developing proposal ideas\, s
 ubmitting proposals\, managing awards through closeout\, and navigating et
 hics\, compliance\, and research security.\n\n \n\nWhile the sessions are 
 especially valuable for new researchers\, all members of the UNC-CH resear
 ch community interested in strengthening their understanding of the resear
 ch enterprise and their roles within it are encouraged to attend.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:TeamOn: Research Team Onboarding
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/teamon-research-team-onboardin
 g
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
