X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20260611T043850Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52897158290480
DTSTART:20260528T180000Z
DTEND:20260528T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:How do you explain your study to your potential study participa
 nt?\n\nConverting scientific concepts into plain\, patient-centered langua
 ge\; foster engaging informed consent conversations\; and obtaining succes
 sful enrollment can be challenging. Join the NC TraCS Recruitment and Rete
 ntion Program to learn how to meet your target audience where they are and
  write clear\, concise recruitment materials with our ‘Make it Clear’ 
 Framework.\n\n \n\nPresenter:\nSummer Choudhury\, MPH\nProgram Manager\, R
 ecruitment & Retention Program\nNC TraCS Institute\n\n \n\nRegister
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Make it Clear: Lay Language Best Practices for Recruitment & Retent
 ion
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/make-it-clear-lay-language-bes
 t-practices-for-recruitment-retention
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
