DESCRIPTION:Financial goals are the specific long- and short-term objective
 s to be attained through financial planning and management efforts. Among 
 personal financial goals are things such as 1) financial security 2) trave
 l 3) education planning 4) retirement planning and 5) estate planning. Bei
 ng able to succeed in reaching these goals requires a structure and plan w
 ith appropriate milestones\, along with the ability to make adjustments al
 ong the way.\n\n \n\nWorkshop Objectives\nAt the end of this workshop\, yo
 u will be able to:\n• Understand the importance of having realistic fina
 ncial goals clearly defined\n• Recognize the importance of managing your
  finances to address these goals\n• Develop achievable steps to stay on 
 track\n• Take appropriate action to monitor progress toward the goals an
 d make adjustments as needed.\n\n \n\nClick on Carolina Talent registratio
 n link and select the “Request” button to automatically enroll.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Financial Planning for Life
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/financial-planning-for-life
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
