UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52931881817685
DTSTART:20260602T220000Z
DTEND:20260602T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:What is the difference between dementia and Alzheimer’s? I ha
 ve 2 family members with Alzheimer’s. What’s my risk like? I hear ther
 e’s a new blood test that can tell me if I have it\; should I get it? Ho
 w good is it? And\, what’s the scoop on those new drugs to slow down Alz
 heimer’s?\n\n \n\nIn June’s Carolina Science Cafe\, Dr. Andrea Bozoki 
 will answer these questions and more as she reviews some key concepts abou
 t Alzheimer's\, explains how specialists approach the evaluation of cognit
 ive decline\, and describes the pros and cons of available treatment optio
 ns.\n\n \n\n🎟️ Free and open to adults\n\n🍴 Light appetizers avail
 able for attendees\n\n🍻 Drinks available for purchase\n\n \n\n📍Hoste
 d by Haw River Tap & Table in Carrboro. \n\n \n\nDesigned for adults\, Car
 olina Science Cafe is a free monthly program by Morehead Planetarium and S
 cience Center that explores science topics making national and internation
 al headlines\, offering the chance to meet the experts behind the work.
GEO:35.910154;-79.068833
LOCATION:Haw River Tap & Table
SUMMARY:Carolina Science Cafe: Dementia Diagnosis and Treatment
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/carolina-science-cafe-dementia
 -diagnosis-and-treatment
CATEGORIES:Lectures
END:VEVENT
