DESCRIPTION:Send the Tar Heels off to Omaha in style! Join us to cheer on C
 arolina Baseball at Boshamer Stadium on Wednesday\, June 10\, as the team 
 heads off to the 2026 Men's College World Series.\n\n \n\nGates to the Bos
 h will open at 10 a.m. with the team coming up to the concourse at approxi
 mately 10:45 to the bus outside the main gate that will depart at 11. Park
 ing will be available at Rams Head Deck for $1.75 per hour.\n\n \n\nThe Di
 amond Heels are making their 13th College World Series appearance and seco
 nd under head coach Scott Forbes. They emerged victorious in the Super Reg
 ional round for the ninth time in program history after pulling off a come
 back in the final two games against USC. A walk-off win on Sunday punctuat
 ed UNC's first ever time winning an NCAA Tournament round after losing the
  first game.\n\n \n\nThe No. 5 national seeded Tar Heels will play Ole Mis
 s on Friday night at 7 p.m. ET.
