DESCRIPTION:The Summer 2026 Four-Day Relational Leadership Institute is a p
 rofessional development program that helps people build teams and organiza
 tional cultures that prioritize connection\, engagement and well-being.\n\
 nNew Location – Relational Leadership at Carolina is excited to offer th
 e Summer 2026 Four-Day Relational Leadership Institute on Zoom!\n\nThe cur
 riculum includes a combination of large and small group interactions to mo
 ve through the four domains of Relational Leadership: manage self\; foster
  teamwork\; coach and develop\; and accelerate change. Completing the prog
 ram requires attendance and participation in all four of the online sessio
 ns on June 1\, 2\, 11\, and 12 from 8:30 a.m. – 4:30 p.m.\n\nRelational 
 Leadership at Carolina is a learning community for the development of huma
 n-centered leaders. Read the story about Relational Leadership @ Carolina 
 celebrating its 500-participant milestone.\n\nRegistration Fee\n\nYour reg
 istration fee includes the four days of programming\; access to a personal
 ized 5Dynamics assessment\; and an invitation to participate in upcoming R
 elational Leadership @ Carolina booster sessions.\nFor participants affili
 ated with UNC and UNC Health\, the registration fee ranges from $250-750. 
 A limited special rate of $250 is available for graduate and post-doctoral
  students and residents.\nFor participants not affiliated with UNC or UNC 
 Health\, the registration fee is $1\,000.\n\nRegister here: \n\n \n\nhttps
 ://apps2.research.unc.edu/events/index.cfm?event=events.go&key=CCEB\n\n\nI
 f you have questions\, email relational_leadership@unc.edu.
