DESCRIPTION:Prepare for summer camping trips with Star Families: Survival S
 kills Using the Sky! 🪐✨\n\n \n\nIn this special planetarium show\, yo
 u'll learn how the sky provides us with a compass\, clock\, and calendar w
 hile touring the constellations and planets most visible this summer.\n\n 
 \n\nStar Families is a monthly series by Morehead Planetarium and Science 
