DTSTART:20260909T160000Z
DTEND:20260909T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Stressful situations\, whether from internal or external source
 s\, are inevitable in organizations. For some managers\, this may lead to 
 over-extending themselves with minimal time for self-care.\nThis training 
 offers tools to help managers cope with stress and thrive in their organiz
 ations.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Self-Care Tips for Managers
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/self-care-tips-for-managers-64
 17
